// name :
"P2823407760" "Looking Through the Glass"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Mission1Clue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P4022949420" "Looking Through the Glass - Part One"
// DetailString :
"P1715560727" "You contacted Agent Adair after the events that transpired with Agent Keith Nance. Agent Adair revealed that the mastermind behind your evil clone was a shapeshifter named Protean, who was working with the 5th Column. Together with your good double, you stormed a 5th Column base to get more information about the situation. There you discovered that Protean was working together with Archon Burkholder, who was defecting to the 5th Column. Protean had lured him to the group under the promise of new Clockwork technology..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - ProteanFiles 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P944078758" "Protean's Information"
// DetailString :
"P1835702937" "You hacked a 5th Column computer and were able to retrieve a dossier about Protean...<br><br><color DarkGray>NAME:<br><br> Anton Jaeger<br><br>Alias:<br><br> Protean<br><br>Abilities:<br><br> Can shapeshift into any humanoid that he has physical contact with.<br><br> Can no longer shapeshift into his original form of Anton Jaeger.<br><br>Recent Activities:<br><br> Heading operations to retake clone laboratory in the Rogue Isles.<br><br>Provided clone of {HeroName} to use in operations, as well as money to hire out bands of Freakshow.<br><br>Current Status:<br><br>Luring Archon Burkholder away from the Council and back to 5th Column, under promise of utilizing new 'Clockwork' technology.</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Mission2Clue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2177496775" "Looking Through the Glass - Part Two"
// DetailString :
"P3379977260" "You contacted Agent Adair after the events that transpired with Agent Keith Nance. Agent Adair revealed that the mastermind behind your evil clone was a shapeshifter named Protean, who was working with the 5th Column. Together with your good double, you stormed a 5th Column base to get more information about the situation. There you discovered that Protean was working together with Archon Burkholder, who was defecting to the 5th Column. Protean had lured him to the group under the promise of new Clockwork technology.<br><br>You and your double discovered where Archon Burkholder would be and ambushed him and his men. After being defeated, Burkholder gave up all the information you needed. The Clockwork technology was from Praetoria, and Protean was working for someone within that dimension. Burkholder also told you that Protean had taken over a Portal Corp lab within Talos and was getting ready to release an army from Praetoria!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - ClockworkFiles 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P206778029" "Clockwork Schematics"
// DetailString :
"P3979828345" "You found the schematics for the 'new' Clockwork that Burkholder was interested in. At the very top there is an indication that these Clockwork come from Praetoria, not from Primal Earth. It's clear now that the deal wasn't for Clockwork on Primal Earth - it was for Clockwork on Praetorian Earth! This must be what Burkholder was so interested in - building an army of new and improved Clockwork!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - ProteanLocation 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1276769791" "Protean's Location"
// DetailString :
"P3455537668" "You defeated Archon Burkholder, who was more than willing to give you the information you needed on Protean.<br><br><color DarkGray>I didn't even want to work with him anyway! I was just spying for the Council, I swear! Look...I know, maybe it's in bad form to give up information on people I worked with, but with Protean around, things will look <i>bad</i> for me with the Center. So, here it is. At this moment, Protean has taken over a hidden Portal Corp facility in Talos. From what he told me, he's planning on sending through the first wave of some sort of Praetorian army.<br><br>So, now that I told you this...maybe you could not send me to the Zig. ...please?</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef - LookingGlassSouvenirClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef Name :
"P3692310107" "Agent Adair's Contact Information"
// tDetailString :
"P3229659353" "Agent Jenni Adair gave you her contact information, should you ever be in need of the services of S.A.M.. Looking it over, it reminds you of an experience you call...<br><br><b>Looking Through the Glass</b><br><br>You contacted Agent Adair after the events that transpired with Agent Keith Nance. Agent Adair revealed that the mastermind behind your evil clone was a shapeshifter named Protean, who was working with the 5th Column. Together with your good double, you stormed a 5th Column base to get more information about the situation. There you discovered that Protean was working together with Archon Burkholder, who was defecting to the 5th Column. Protean had lured him to the 5th Column with the promise of new Clockwork technology.<br><br>You and your double discovered where Archon Burkholder would be and ambushed him and his men. After being defeated, Burkholder gave up all the information you needed. The Clockwork technology was from Praetoria, and Protean was working for someone within that dimension. Burkholder also told you that Protean had taken over a Portal Corp lab within Talos and was getting ready to release an army from Praetoria!<br><br>Wasting no time, you and your double attacked the lab. You were able to defeat Protean, but your double could not deactivate the portal manually. Your double made the ultimate sacrifice to destroy the portal, stopping the Praetorian army's invasion. Your double's last words to you still echo in your mind...<br><br>'It's up to you. You have two worlds to defend now.' "

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1690506303" "Here's the situation, {HeroName}. We're aware that Protean has ties to the 5th Column. He used these ties to support this evil double of yours.<br><br>We're concerned about how deep his connections to the 5th Column run. Has Protean become a major player within the group, or is he just using them?<br><br>Your double has been doing some investigating on the side and discovered the location of a 5th Column base here in Talos Island. That base <i>should</i> have records pertaining to dealings that the 5th Column have had with Protean. We need you and your double to get in there and get any information you can."
// AcceptString :
"P3461401376" "We're on it."
// SendOffString :
"P1551751717" "Excellent. We've provided your double with a link to the earpiece that Agent Nance gave you. This will allow the two of you to communicate back and forth. While you're inside the base looking for the data, your double will be in another part, helping to secure the area to buy you enough time to find what you need.<br><br><color orange>Objectives within the mission that are marked as (Mirror's Objective) will be goals that your double is working on.</color>"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1887987308" "Find Information on Protean."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1595959168" "{HeroName}, I can not stress enough the importance of you finding proof of Protean's plans. The longer you wait, the more likely any evidence will be destroyed.  Go to that 5th Column base and find proof in regards to what Protean is up to."
// TaskTitle :
"P2120818895" "<color deepskyblue>Looking Through the Glass</color>"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P2886319384" "<color deepskyblue>Part One: My Own Ally</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2888130463" "This looks like the secret base that Special Agent Jenni Adair told you about.  Find evidence about what Protean is up to!"
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P3476281038" "Destroy Base Defenses (Mirror's Objective)"
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P3899105983" "Defeat incoming 5th Column (Mirror's Objective), Disarm 4 Computers (Mirror's Objective) "
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P3678075659" "<t=4 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor black>This is your double, {HeroName}. I'm in the base now.<t=4 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5  d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor black>I'll be working on taking down the defense grid so you can access the computer.<t=4 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5  d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor black>I'll let you know if anything comes up in the meantime."
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P856364347" ""
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P2755496993" "Get the information organized, we can't afford to lose Burkholder!"
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P3723828205" "{HeroName}?!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P3441212388" "<t=4 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor black>And...there. You should be clear to get to that computer.<t=4 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5  d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor black>Looks like disarming their defenses set off an alarm...!<t=4 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5  d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor black>I'll be OK. You focus on getting to that computer!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P2062320547" "{HeroName} is around here somewhere!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P4282495387" "Oberst Heinkamp"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P4027028812" "We know you are here, {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P229233219" "This is much bigger than you, {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2836457115" "Now you die!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1738482053" "Nevermind"

