"P4031813902" "Stop Protean's Invasion"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3974199566" "{HeroName}, it's up to you now to protect earth from an inter-dimensional invasion!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3132304306" "This is it, the final confrontation with Protean. He's the one who started this whole mess with your evil double running around. You're the one who's going to finish it."
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P1185082073" "Five seconds until detonation!"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2092788688" "<t=4 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor black>I'm sneaking in now, {HeroName}. We'll make sure Protean doesn't get away with this!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3980128313" "<t=4 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor black>Alright, I'm in the main portal room.<t=5 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5  d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor black>...no! Protean...he's already activated the portal! The army is pouring out...wait...what the..?! <t=5 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5  d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor black>The army...{HeroName}...it's US!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2856156344" "<t=4 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor black>This...is looking...bad...{HeroName}...<t=5 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5  d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor black>5th Column...starting to come in...I've triggered...the explosives...on the generators here...<t=5 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5  d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor black>The reactions...might occur near Protean...so be...careful...while you're fighting...him..."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2450237675" "<t=5 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor black>I've started the destruction sequence. I...I couldn't disable the portal through...any other means..."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1033067606" "<t=5 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor black>I...can buy you...some time...{HeroName}...to defeat Protean...but you need...to get out of here...as fast as possible...after that..."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1350866826" "<t=5 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor black>I'll...have to stay...to make sure...the clones don't disable...the destruction sequence...just make sure...to get out of here..."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P622548676" "<t=5 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor black>Get out of here...{HeroName}...there's not much...time left...!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3793214176" "I'm dead!"

