// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3773386295" "Oberst Neinch"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3419862483" "You won't stop our glorious rise to power, {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P4208776740" "Protean"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1402577888" "So...{HeroName} thinks that {Hero.gender=male he|she} can stop this? Funny."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2389749379" "{HeroName}, so good of you to show up. You've saved me the trouble of tracking you down!"
// Script Variable BOSS_1ST_DIALOG :
"P804598604" "What?! What's going on?!"
// Script Variable BOSS_2ND_DIALOG :
"P2091506628" "So, you've got someone helping you, {HeroName}? It doesn't matter, do you hear me?! You're both dead!"
// Script Variable BOSS_3RD_DIALOG :
"P2404613309" "I'll enjoy making you scream for mercy, just like Galaxy Girl's little sidekick!"
// Script Variable BOSS_4TH_DIALOG :
"P2257559335" "This is far from over, {HeroName}. Manticore couldn't kill me, what makes you think YOU can?!"
// Script Variable BOSS_5TH_DIALOG :
"P1169355288" "This isn't...the end...my destiny is greater...than you could begin to imagine...!"

